  "prefLabel": "Geo 103.03 The Chairperson and Vice Chairperson",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Geo 103.03 The Chairperson and Vice Chairperson. The chairperson shall preside at all meetings. In the absence of the chairperson, the vice-chairperson shall preside.\n\nSource. #7524, eff 7-1-01",
